# The chat's side panel (ChatSide.tsx useSidePanel, wide_panel.mbt side_beside): MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the made-up
# chat. Opened by the chat bar's switch (its first agent's history in from the pane's right edge, the chat narrowing
# with it), closed by the panel's (out the other way), then opened and closed again.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap icon:panel-open
wait 900
tap icon:panel-close
wait 900
tap icon:panel-open
wait 900
tap icon:panel-close
wait 900
exit
